sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant RPM as RelayPoolManager
    participant Pool as SimplePool
    participant R1 as Relay 1
    participant R2 as Relay 2
    participant R3 as Relay 3
    participant HM as Health Monitor

    App->>RPM: subscribe(filters)
    RPM->>RPM: Select healthy relays
    RPM->>Pool: subscribeMany([R1, R2, R3], filters)

    activate Pool
    Pool->>R1: Subscribe
    Pool->>R2: Subscribe
    Pool->>R3: Subscribe

    R1-->>Pool: Event 1
    R2-->>Pool: Event 1 (duplicate)
    R3-->>Pool: Event 2

    Pool->>RPM: Event 1 (deduplicated)
    Pool->>RPM: Event 2
    deactivate Pool

    RPM->>RPM: Validate events
    RPM->>App: onEvent(Event 1)
    RPM->>App: onEvent(Event 2)

    HM->>R1: Ping
    R1-->>HM: Pong (50ms)
    HM->>HM: Update metrics

    Note over R2: Connection Lost
    R2--xHM: Timeout
    HM->>RPM: Relay R2 unhealthy
    RPM->>RPM: Remove R2 from pool
    RPM->>RPM: Trigger reconnection

    HM->>R2: Reconnect attempt
    R2-->>HM: Connected
    HM->>RPM: Relay R2 healthy
    RPM->>RPM: Add R2 back to pool
